---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';

/**
 * Terms of use EN, mirror of cs/terms.astro (personal subscriptions on the
 * web and in the App Store, melveo-app #1606). Do not publish before sales
 * launch. Czech version is authoritative in disputes. Decisions on
 * Sections 7, 9 and 16: owner delegation, 4 Nov 2026 (#1606).
 */

const lastUpdated = '2026-11-04';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms governing use of the Melveo app and website and personal subscriptions."
  lang="en"
>
  <PageHeader lang="en" />
  <article class="legal-article">
    <p class="legal-eyebrow">Effective · {lastUpdated}</p>
    <h1 class="legal-h1">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">
      These Terms of Use (the Terms) govern the relationship between the
      operator of the Melveo app and website and its users, including personal
      subscriptions. They are based on Czech Act No. 89/2012 Coll. (Civil Code)
      and related legal regulations. The Czech version prevails in disputes.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h2>1. Operator</h2>
    <p class="legal-block">
      <strong>QUIX Global s.r.o.</strong><br />
      Company ID (IČO): 22466444<br />
      Registered office: Příčná 1892/4, Nové Město, 110 00 Prague 1, Czech
      Republic<br />
      Data box: <code>g7v78rx</code><br />
      Commercial Register: file C 416432, Municipal Court in Prague<br />
      <br />
      Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@melveo.app">hello@melveo.app</a>
    </p>

    <h2>2. Definitions</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>App</strong>: the Melveo mobile app for iPhone and iPad,
        available in the Apple App Store.</li>
      <li><strong>Website</strong>: the <code>melveo.app</code> website.</li>
      <li><strong>User</strong>: a natural person using the App or Website as
        a player, coach or parent.</li>
      <li><strong>Subscription</strong>: a personal paid plan under Section 5,
        bought on the Website or in the App Store.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Subject of the agreement</h2>
    <p>
      Melveo is an app and website for sports teams, mainly in handball. It
      offers schedules and attendance, check-ins, injury records, heart rate
      and HRV, training load, tests, match recording and reports, match video
      and team messages. Melveo has no clubs, club licences or team packages.
      Each user enters into the agreement with us personally.
    </p>
    <p>
      Melveo is not a medical device, an emergency service or a substitute for
      professional healthcare. It does not diagnose or treat. Its outputs are
      indicative only.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Account and formation of the agreement</h2>
    <p>
      The agreement to use the service is formed when you create an account.
      You can sign in with Apple, Google or an email one-time code. Provide
      accurate details, especially your date of birth, because the rules for
      consent and purchases depend on age. A Subscription agreement is formed
      by an order under Section 6.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Free use and Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      Basic use is free forever: players have the Warm-up plan, coaches the
      Throw-off plan. Free features include the team, invitations, parents,
      calendar, attendance, check-in, HRV, match and simple report, basic
      testing and messages.
    </p>
    <p>Paid Subscriptions are personal and monthly only:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>players: <strong>Momentum</strong> and <strong>MVP</strong>;</li>
      <li>coaches: <strong>Playbook</strong> and <strong>Gameplan</strong>.
        Gameplan includes match video with 500 GB of storage and AI commentary.
        In each paid period you can upload up to 50 GB of video and create AI
        commentary for up to 10 matches. Once used up, the feature is not
        removed; you just cannot upload or create more until the period ends.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      A higher plan includes everything in the lower one. A coach plan does not
      include a player plan. What each plan contains is described in the
      current offer on the Website and in the App. A Subscription does not
      change your role or what you can see of other people's data.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Where you pay</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>On the Website melveo.app</strong> by card through Stripe
        Payments Europe Ltd. We sell the Subscription to you.</li>
      <li><strong>In the App</strong> through the App Store. Apple sells and
        collects payment under its own terms (Apple Media Services Terms).
        Apple handles payment, renewal, cancellation and refunds as described
        in Section 8.2.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Prices may differ by channel. Website prices are in euros; App Store
      prices are set and shown by the App Store in your country's currency.
      The price shown at the time of the order applies. You can hold the
      player and the coach plan family only once at a time and only with one
      seller: if you subscribe through the App Store, you cannot buy the same
      family on the Website, and vice versa.
    </p>
    <!-- Verified 4 Nov 2026: ADIS classifies CZ22466444 as
         IDENTIFIKOVANA_OSOBA, not PLATCE_DPH. Active ARES / valid VIES status
         does not establish full VAT-payer registration. This does not determine
         the tax treatment of a particular sale or future registration; see cs. -->
    <p>
      Website prices are final. The operator <em>is currently not a VAT
      payer.</em> We will inform you of any change under Section 18. For App
      Store purchases, Apple remits VAT.
    </p>

