      deleted in line with the Privacy Policy. For Subscriptions see Section 8.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Melveo is not a medical device or a diagnostic tool.</strong>
      App outputs are supporting information for human decisions. Coaches and
      staff remain responsible for sporting, organisational and health and
